---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="SMS Terms" description="Review Aura Living's draft terms for consent-based, low-volume one-to-one resident and client SMS." path="/sms-terms/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="SMS Terms" title="A clear agreement for useful messages." intro="These draft terms describe how Aura Living may use consent-based SMS for one-to-one resident and client support communications." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container content-grid"><article class="content-copy">
    <p><strong>Last updated: March 2025</strong></p>
    <h2>Program description</h2><p>The Aura Living SMS program is intended for low-volume, one-to-one messages with residents, property owners, or prospective clients who have provided permission. Messages may relate to rental payments, maintenance, inspections, lease renewals, appointment coordination, and support questions.</p>
    <h2>Consent</h2><p>By checking an SMS consent box, providing consent through an agreed process, or otherwise asking to receive text messages, you agree that Aura Living may send messages to the number provided for the purposes described above. Consent is optional and is not a condition of purchasing services. We do not treat this program as permission for unsolicited bulk marketing.</p>
    <h2>Message frequency and costs</h2><p>Message frequency varies based on your requests and active property matters. Messages and data rates may apply. Your mobile provider’s terms and charges remain your responsibility.</p>
    <h2>Opting out and getting help</h2><p>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to stop receiving SMS messages. You may receive a confirmation of the opt-out. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance or contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You can also contact us through the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page. You may still receive essential non-SMS service communications where appropriate.</p>
    <h2>Delivery limitations</h2><p>SMS availability depends on provider approval, carrier registration, network coverage, device settings, and other factors outside Aura Living’s control. Final SMS activation depends on provider approval and carrier registration. We do not promise that every message will be delivered, delivered on time, or available in every location.</p>
    <h2>Information and privacy</h2><p>We may use the phone number and message details needed to operate the program and respond to the related request. See the <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> for the draft approach to contact data, service providers, security, retention, and rights.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update these terms if the program or providers change. The latest version will be posted on this page. This local website does not currently send SMS messages.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Phone: {site.phone} (placeholder).</p>
  </article><aside class="side-card"><h2>Good to know</h2><p>No active SMS service is connected. Any future activation requires a finalized program, consent flow, provider approval, and carrier registration.</p><a class="button" href="/privacy-policy/">Read Privacy Policy</a></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
